    AvatarPos: 0
    AvatarType: 0
    Texts:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: When the crew started yelling for everyone to get upstairs,
        it was complete chaos. The deck was slipping everywhere.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: "\u4E57\u7D44\u54E1\u304C\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3092 \u968E\u6BB5\u3092\u4E0A\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u53EB\u3093\u3060\u6642
        \u5B8C\u5168\u306B\u6DF7\u4E71\u3057\u305F"
